WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.653
Week 19: Imperfect: Background and Habit. describe how things used to be set a scene contrast past and present

2
00:00:07.653 --> 00:00:13.919
Mission brief. Describe a place ten years ago and explain three ways daily life changed.

3
00:00:13.919 --> 00:00:23.302
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:23.302 --> 00:00:30.997
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:39.439
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:39.439 --> 00:01:06.380
Model language. Antes había menos edificios. — There used to be fewer buildings. De niña jugaba en esta plaza. — As a girl, I used to play in this plaza. Eran las ocho y llovía mucho. — It was eight o'clock and raining heavily. Mientras trabajábamos, escuchábamos la radio. — While we worked, we listened to the radio. La ciudad parecía más tranquila. — The city seemed quieter.

7
00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:16.129
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
